&_nc_oc=AdrzK8Po3hfY45Q56Yiyk-OxOE5X7YZ8HJGrP3VP05A692gGDgvJTcFFVkTBn2sqM3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGVlc3cVgOEhBbp_EFeSyQ3oMr6xSIG0-9eTVW77w6H1Q&oe=6A9410FE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FzKzc6cMDm8Q7kNvwH9aibC&_nc_oc=AdphByPqABKCWbnSsVAKfikSDfFyltRooBsn8o-JIL4_oGpXcVJBvRtd0fw1OwlOo88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFZWwKZ2J36dP3KwHP2qHeZglUZJdVLkIkrjqHn9YML6w&oe=6A9421FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SFGkhcgM3KQQ7kNvwFJ_p3t&_nc_oc=Adr8KMdZIVPAVY90VVkfSe-QLgMIcuDkGpfR1lE-scrfhgMDYHxmN0mh3NRUMH1cWnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQESzC3TSQSr4E2g5Ii4ZBh9pisPMOxFHKF5SKdWuDz77A&oe=6A940847"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCW7gqOIWpEQ7kNvwF4k6K4&_nc_oc=Adp73vABmEfqeEmdDXCucspdtBrLFxf1V0ifhyDWNKT93Bnc-eqJhNPVvs-Pv3Zq0VI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH8Dm8IVReSm0JdGeYsqKNk6sAcZd4n5kk6MwZZnaQVSg&oe=6A942C55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I23MnBqxQCwQ7kNvwHcVzoi&_nc_oc=AdoEDkhSPfJJh_xLYLrulwm7GMUMwW0PZqJmeRz1znz0nychzm9t5Gjnv31drEatg90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGxD1mywOc7PDuL3q9-VG2hmL3H6Hg58xuo28GZASF4YQ&oe=6A9400A4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.